<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.599 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.599 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.5990 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6047 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 9		   Oct 7</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.5990		  4.6047</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    20,000		  10,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
